column119:
14/Jun/12 3:38 PM;557058:30a754c9-d9e6-464f-9f97-cb727ac8158f;This is the old bit of code in nginx responsible for not getting stories cached

        # Try not to send the stories to squid
        if ( $uri  ~* "^/works/.*" ) {
           set $logged_out '';
        }

The new code looks like this

        # Try not to send the stories to squid
        if ( $uri  ~* "/works/.*" ) {
           set $logged_out '';
        }

And will catch stories in a collection

