I initially tried to leave a comment using the following user agent with a character length around 550: {{}}

This led to Cloudflare giving me a “Shields are Up!” message and asking me to verify if I was human. I clicked the tickbox and successfully passed to be let back into AO3. However, my comment was not posted to the work. I tried this again two times, and neither was successful.

I then tried to leave a comment using the following user agent with a character length of 412:

{{Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64; rv:138.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/138.0 Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64; rv:138.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/138.0 Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64; rv:138.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/138.0 Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64; rv:138.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/138.0 Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64; rv:138.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/138.0 Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64; rv:138.0) Gecko/20100101 }}

