column125:
16/Jun/14 12:58 PM;557058:0670e11e-5036-4aae-af3f-d6ae02967b60;Made a skin like this:

.listbox.group {
  background: teal;
}

.index.group {
  background: orange;
}

The bars at the top and bottom of Dashboard sections (gray in the default skin) are
now teal.

The bars at the top and bottom of sections on /media are teal.

The bars on the collection Dashboard are teal.

The background behind the whole list of blurbs (including the blurbs themselves) in
work listing pages (/works, /user/USERNAME/works, /tag/TAGNAME/works, /collections/COLLECTIONNAME/works)
is orange.

The same is true for bookmark listing pages.

On /media, the background behind the fandom listings is orange.

The blurbs on the user Dashboard, the History, /requests, and Collection Dashboards
are not colored.

Is this all as it should be?  I have no idea.

This is that skin for testy: http://test.archiveofourown.org/skins/9569
